1146+ 0B5E              ;
1147+ 0B5E              ; Guest RAM allocation starts at NeoGS physical page 44h.
1148+ 0B5E              ; Guest byte address maps linearly to physical offset 110000h + guest address.
1149+ 0B5E              ; WIN3 is a permanently reserved bank aperture; its current page is volatile.
