 720+ 850D              ; VGA aperture memory backend — PCem svga_read/svga_write model.
 721+ 850D              ; IN: x86_phys_addr is the guest physical address; write takes A=value.
 722+ 850D              ; VRAM is the separate 256 KiB physical allocation pages30h..3Fh.
 723+ 850D              ; Every physical byte is accessed through WIN3/MPAGEX, never as a flat
 724+ 850D              ; 128 KiB aperture mirror. The four VGA planes are interleaved in VRAM.
 725+ 850D              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
